OL-1500R Online Double-Conversion UPS: Data Sheet
Document OL1500R-DS Rev 4, 03/2024.
Ratings
Parameter Value
Rating 1500 VA / 1350 W
Topology Online double-conversion
Input / output 120 V AC, 60 Hz
Internal battery 4 x 12 V, 9 Ah VRLA (432 Wh nominal)
Usable battery energy 376 Wh at 25 degC, new battery, to 10.5 V per block
Inverter efficiency, battery mode 88 percent
Standing loss, online mode (no load) 40 W
Enclosure mounting Rack or DIN-plate, -20 to +50 degC
Runtime
Runtime at constant output load, computed from the usable battery energy, the inverter efficiency and the
online standing loss above. Derate 20 percent at end of battery life and below 10 degC.
